{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bushi</strong> is a precision third-person arena brawler. Run up and along walls with fluid mobility and full environmental interaction. Carefully time your attacks in epic multiplayer battles as you move swiftly through scenic arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/96905311744d03597a1b9a98fe5b17a9.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/b64df5b9d015da42c8b6463fa4ea0cfe.poster.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/b64df5b9d015da42c8b6463fa4ea0cfe.webm?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/b64df5b9d015da42c8b6463fa4ea0cfe.mp4?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong>\u00a0- Fast-paced, skill-based action for up to ten players online. Master the sword and bow to gracefully dispatch friends and foes alike. Slash through enemies with a high-speed dash, outplay opponents with precise directional dodges, and turn the tables with perfectly timed parries. Control the flow of battle with deadly, long-range arrow strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/26bbf8e070e827e50628e356d16e28e1.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/09b0861f99d21eda3202436934c21afe.poster.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/09b0861f99d21eda3202436934c21afe.webm?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Parkour</strong>\u00a0- Move seamlessly across the map while fighting simultaneously. Run, jump, dash, and mantle through beautiful Japanese-themed environments. Scale walls for a vertical advantage, run along them to chase or evade, and leap between surfaces to disorient your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/c9f2b9b71ef225acdd15f818893b7274.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6ba79844cd7534485c097051edf05795.poster.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6ba79844cd7534485c097051edf05795.webm?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Modes</strong>\u00a0- Experience a variety of exciting and expanding game modes. Prove your strength in <strong>Duel</strong>, stand alone or with your squad in <strong>Execution</strong>, dominate the battlefield in <strong>Deathmatch</strong> and <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, or take control in <strong>King of the Hill</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are <strong>Son Goku</strong>, shape-shifting Warrior King. After traveling the world to master duplication and transformation, you return home despondent and bored. You\u2019ve challenged everyone and won. Now what?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while slouching on your throne, a cunning river dragon approaches you with a wager. She bets you can\u2019t win a fight against your own clones. You\u2019re almost disappointed you didn\u2019t think of it first. Confident and bored senseless, you accept without hesitation and summon your clones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the battle begin.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1548340?t=1762824724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/0185331f4396ff254e0cc19015e48ec76ea3a5c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762824724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/4c4cfeaa1fd1c55b0ddd34df6a3fb3c8c0fe57d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762824724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/4c4cfeaa1fd1c55b0ddd34df6a3fb3c8c0fe57d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762824724","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bushi</strong> is a precision third-person arena brawler. Run up and along walls with fluid mobility and full environmental interaction. Carefully time your attacks in epic multiplayer battles as you move swiftly through scenic arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/96905311744d03597a1b9a98fe5b17a9.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/b64df5b9d015da42c8b6463fa4ea0cfe.poster.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/b64df5b9d015da42c8b6463fa4ea0cfe.webm?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/b64df5b9d015da42c8b6463fa4ea0cfe.mp4?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong>\u00a0- Fast-paced, skill-based action for up to ten players online. Master the sword and bow to gracefully dispatch friends and foes alike. Slash through enemies with a high-speed dash, outplay opponents with precise directional dodges, and turn the tables with perfectly timed parries. Control the flow of battle with deadly, long-range arrow strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/26bbf8e070e827e50628e356d16e28e1.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/09b0861f99d21eda3202436934c21afe.poster.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/09b0861f99d21eda3202436934c21afe.webm?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Parkour</strong>\u00a0- Move seamlessly across the map while fighting simultaneously. Run, jump, dash, and mantle through beautiful Japanese-themed environments. Scale walls for a vertical advantage, run along them to chase or evade, and leap between surfaces to disorient your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/c9f2b9b71ef225acdd15f818893b7274.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6ba79844cd7534485c097051edf05795.poster.avif?t=1762824724\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/extras/6ba79844cd7534485c097051edf05795.webm?t=1762824724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Modes</strong>\u00a0- Experience a variety of exciting and expanding game modes. Prove your strength in <strong>Duel</strong>, stand alone or with your squad in <strong>Execution</strong>, dominate the battlefield in <strong>Deathmatch</strong> and <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, or take control in <strong>King of the Hill</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are <strong>Son Goku</strong>, shape-shifting Warrior King. After traveling the world to master duplication and transformation, you return home despondent and bored. You\u2019ve challenged everyone and won. Now what?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while slouching on your throne, a cunning river dragon approaches you with a wager. She bets you can\u2019t win a fight against your own clones. You\u2019re almost disappointed you didn\u2019t think of it first. Confident and bored senseless, you accept without hesitation and summon your clones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the battle begin.</p>","developers":["Afrowhale"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548340/7a8b41e591b7e04993805fa5ceda601cd85a6870/header.jpg?t=1762824724","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1548340/1751963880/f5ddbcb8073ec8c37f863b12018f11a82845c17a/1761870544/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762464137","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1548340/1751963880/f5ddbcb8073ec8c37f863b12018f11a82845c17a/1761870544/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762464137","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1548340/1751963880/f5ddbcb8073ec8c37f863b12018f11a82845c17a/1761870544/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762464137","id":257224471,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224471/movie480.mp4?t=1762464137","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224471/movie_max.mp4?t=1762464137"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224471/0b31c646fffb61e7b141017567c5115c9003357f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762464137","webm":{"